#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Node Access"
msgstr "Nodustoegang"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to the ssh client on each poller that reads nodes."
msgstr "Absolute pad na die ssh-kliënt op elke poller wat nodusse lees."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SSH Client"
msgstr "SSH-kliënt"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path, on each poller that reads nodes, to the private key whose public half each node lists in authorized_keys with a forced command running pfs-read.sh. Readable only by the poller user. The plugin never creates, copies, or prints it."
msgstr "Absolute pad, op elke poller wat nodusse lees, na die privaat sleutel waarvan elke nodus die openbare helfte in authorized_keys lys met 'n gedwonge opdrag wat pfs-read.sh uitvoer. Slegs leesbaar deur die poller-gebruiker. Die inprop skep, kopieer of druk dit nooit nie."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SSH Key File"
msgstr "SSH-sleutellêer"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to the known_hosts file holding each node host key under the node endpoint name. A node whose key is missing or changed is not read."
msgstr "Absolute pad na die known_hosts-lêer wat elke nodus se gasheersleutel onder die nodus se eindpuntnaam hou. 'n Nodus waarvan die sleutel ontbreek of verander het, word nie gelees nie."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Known Hosts File"
msgstr "Bekende-gashere-lêer"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Connect Timeout"
msgstr "Verbindingstydlimiet"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds to wait for a node to accept the connection."
msgstr "Sekondes om te wag vir 'n nodus om die verbinding te aanvaar."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Read Timeout"
msgstr "Leestydlimiet"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one node read may take in total before it is stopped and recorded as failed."
msgstr "Sekondes wat een noduslees in totaal mag neem voordat dit gestop en as misluk aangeteken word."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "KiB one node may return. A larger answer is discarded and recorded as failed."
msgstr "KiB wat een nodus mag terugstuur. 'n Groter antwoord word weggegooi en as misluk aangeteken."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Maximum Response"
msgstr "Maksimum antwoord"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Reader"
msgstr "Leser"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Reader Time Budget"
msgstr "Lesertydbegroting"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one reader run may spend before it stops starting node reads. Keep it below the poller interval; unread nodes are read on the next run."
msgstr "Sekondes wat een leserlopie mag bestee voordat dit ophou om noduslesings te begin. Hou dit onder die poller-interval; ongeleesde nodusse word tydens die volgende lopie gelees."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Concurrent Reads"
msgstr "Gelyktydige lesings"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Node reads one reader runs at the same time."
msgstr "Noduslesings wat een leser gelyktydig uitvoer."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Deïnstalleer"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Behou inproptabelle by deïnstallasie"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its filesystems, nodes, inventory, and cache. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them; export the registry first from the Parallel Filesystem Admin page. Storage nodes are never contacted either way."
msgstr "Wanneer gemerk, behou die deïnstallering van die inprop sy lêerstelsels, nodusse, voorraad en kas. Maak dit skoon sodat die deïnstallering dit verwyder; voer die register eers uit vanaf die Parallel Filesystem Admin-bladsy. Bergingsnodusse word in elk geval nooit gekontak nie."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Delete the Devices This Plugin Created on Uninstall"
msgstr "Skrap die toestelle wat hierdie inprop geskep het tydens deïnstallering"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin deletes the devices it created for filesystems, with their graphs and data sources, as deleting them in Cacti would. Existing devices that were mapped to a filesystem are never deleted. RRD files are removed only if Cacti's own RRD cleanup setting removes them. Cleared, the devices stay."
msgstr "Wanneer gemerk, skrap die deïnstallering van die inprop die toestelle wat dit vir lêerstelsels geskep het, saam met hul grafieke en databronne, net soos om dit in Cacti te skrap. Bestaande toestelle wat aan 'n lêerstelsel gekoppel is, word nooit geskrap nie. RRD-lêers word slegs verwyder as Cacti se eie RRD-opruimingsinstelling dit verwyder. Wanneer ongemerk, bly die toestelle."

