msgstr "Die lêerstelsel kon nie gestoor word nie."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The filesystem was saved."
msgstr "Die lêerstelsel is gestoor."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The filesystem, its nodes, and its inventory were deleted. Its Cacti device, data sources, and graphs were kept. No node was contacted."
msgstr "Die lêerstelsel, sy nodusse en sy voorraad is geskrap. Sy Cacti-toestel, databronne en grafieke is behou. Geen nodus is gekontak nie."

#: pfs_admin.php
