msgid "The node could not be saved."
msgstr "Die nodus kon nie gestoor word nie."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The node was saved."
msgstr "Die nodus is gestoor."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The node was deleted. Targets it reported keep their history."
msgstr "Die nodus is geskrap. Teikens wat dit gerapporteer het, behou hul geskiedenis."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "Enter a network as an address and prefix length, such as 10.20.0.0/16."
msgstr "Voer 'n netwerk as 'n adres en voorvoegsellengte in, soos 10.20.0.0/16."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "No device was added: the filesystem already has one, or the templates are not installed."
msgstr "Geen toestel is bygevoeg nie: die lêerstelsel het reeds een, of die sjablone is nie geïnstalleer nie."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The device could not be mapped. It may be mapped to another filesystem."
msgstr "Die toestel kon nie gekoppel word nie. Dit is moontlik aan 'n ander lêerstelsel gekoppel."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The device was mapped and the data queries and overview graphs were added."
msgstr "Die toestel is gekoppel en die datanavrae en oorsiggrafieke is bygevoeg."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "Cacti did not create the device. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Cacti het nie die toestel geskep nie. Sien die Cacti-logboek."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The device, its data queries, and its overview graphs were created."
msgstr "Die toestel, sy datanavrae en sy oorsiggrafieke is geskep."

#: pfs_admin.php
msgid "The device is no longer mapped. It and its graphs were kept; its data queries list no targets until it is mapped again."
msgstr "Die toestel is nie meer gekoppel nie. Dit en sy grafieke is behou; sy datanavrae lys geen teikens totdat dit weer gekoppel word nie."

